  "series_spec": {
    "description": "Number of mithun tagged with Pashu Aadhaar (NDLM) in each district. Pashu Aadhaar is the UIDAI-style 12-digit tag issued by the National Digital Livestock Mission to individual animals; the count here is a count of tags issued, NOT an estimate of the actual mithun population of the district. Coverage varies by state as the rollout is in progress."
  },
  "methodology": {
    "definition": "Number of mithun tagged with Pashu Aadhaar (NDLM) in each district. Pashu Aadhaar is the UIDAI-style 12-digit tag issued by the National Digital Livestock Mission to individual animals; the count here is a count of tags issued, NOT an estimate of the actual mithun population of the district. Coverage varies by state as the rollout is in progress.",
